| Error              | Meaning                          | Important?   | Action                  |
| ------------------ | -------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------- |
| `404 /favicon.ico` | Website icon not found           | ❌ Usually no | Ignore or add favicon   |
| `404 /some-page`   | Requested page/API doesn't exist | ⚠️ Yes       | Check URL/route         |
| `500 /chat`        | Backend crashed or failed        | 🔴 Yes       | Check backend logs/code |
| `200`              | Success                          | ✅            | Nothing                 |

